@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #64748B
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #334155
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #64748B
title 음식 → 사케 추천: DB 후보와 영속 캐시

actor 사용자 as U
participant "Next.js 추천 화면" as F
participant "RecommendController" as C
participant "RecommendService" as S
participant "RecommendMapper XML" as M
participant "GeminiRecommendService" as AI
database "MySQL" as DB

U -> F : 음식 입력·추천 요청
F -> C : POST /api/recommend/sake {food}
activate C
C -> S : sakeRecommendList(food)
activate S
S -> M : getSakeRecommendList(trim(food))
M -> DB : RECOMMEND_SAKE + SAKE 조회
DB --> M : 저장된 추천
alt 캐시 hit
  M --> S : 추천 목록
else 캐시 miss
  S -> AI : analyzeFood(food)
  AI --> S : 종류·주도·산도·정미율 범위
  S -> M : getSakeRecommendCandidates(condition)
  M -> DB : SAKE_RECOMMEND_PROFILE 점수화
  DB --> M : 상위 40개 실제 SAKE
  M --> S : 후보
  S -> AI : rerankSake(food, condition, candidates)
  AI --> S : sakeNo 3개 + reason
  S -> S : 개수·중복·후보 포함 검증
  S -> M : insertSakeRecommend(...)
  M -> DB : RECOMMEND_SAKE INSERT
  S -> M : getSakeRecommendList(food)
  M -> DB : DB 제품 정보 재조회
  DB --> M : 추천 목록
end
S -> S : 결과 3개 확인
S --> C : SakeRecommendResponse
deactivate S
C --> F : JSON
deactivate C
F --> U : 사케 상세 정보 + 추천 이유
@enduml
